  "description": "Losing sleep can make you lose your mind, but what would you do if the cause was an evil spirit who uses your body like a puppet in the night? Woo-Shin Joo’s answer was to end his life so he could finally rest. Now, he wanders around as a spirit. Meanwhile, his body is kept alive by his wealthy parents who have hired a handsome medium, I-Rok, to find him and bring his soul back. Can I-Rok get Woo-Shin home and exorcise the spirit who haunts him? And more importantly, will Woo-Shin ever rest?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
